+Unreleased
+^^^^^^^^^^
+
+- **Behavior change:** ``JSONStorage`` now writes keys sorted by default to
+  keep database files diff-friendly. Pass ``sort_keys=False`` to keep
+  insertion order. Data that can't be sorted (e.g. mixed ``int``/``str``
+  keys) is written unsorted.
+
